                                "sense_id": "6dae2e3d-a5dd-362d-8c2e-ace0b40b6f00",
                                "text": "Notice that franciums are balanced without even thinking in moles, atoms, or whatever."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4ca3ef32-42e1-4278-a218-dbd17279d9d2",
                                "sense_id": "6dae2e3d-a5dd-362d-8c2e-ace0b40b6f00",
                                "text": "(a) Radons and poloniums are compared, (b) poloniums and astatines are compared and (c) radons and franciums are compared."
